      "content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>The Mathematical City · Mini AI Labs</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#07090c;color:#f4f0e8;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding:48px 20px 70px}.k{color:#67d4ca;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase}h1{font:400 clamp(48px,8vw,94px)/.92 Georgia,serif;margin:18px 0 14px}.lead{max-width:780px;color:#a8b0b2;font:18px/1.55 Georgia,serif}.cycle{margin:28px 0;border-top:1px solid #263338;border-bottom:1px solid #263338;padding:14px 0;color:#9aa8ab;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}.card{background:#101518;border:1px solid #263338;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden}.art{height:300px;display:block;position:relative;background:#050708}.art img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}.art span{position:absolute;top:14px;left:14px;background:#071011d9;border:1px solid #67d4ca66;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#c7efeb}.body{padding:20px}small{color:#67d4ca;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.15em}h2{font:400 40px/1 Georgia,serif;margin:8px 0 12px}p{color:#aeb6b8;font:italic 17px/1.45 Georgia,serif;min-height:48px}.body a{color:#f4f0e8;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;border-bottom:1px solid #526267;padding-bottom:2px}footer{margin-top:28px;border-top:1px solid #263338;padding-top:18px;color:#768589;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:760px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.art{height:250px}}</style></head><body><main><div class=\"k\">The Mathematical City · Mini AI Labs</div><h1>Ten live labs.<br>One recursive instrument.</h1><p class=\"lead\">A single visual language for structure, invariance, dynamics, memory, measurement, prediction, flow, persistence, construction and restoration.</p><div class=\"cycle\">SPECTRA → Fold → Murmuration → Mnemosyne → Density → Horizon → Wave → Identity → BUILD → SOAR → SPECTRA</div><section class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card\"><a class=\"art\" href=\"https://prairie-dream-glow-fire.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://gpkjvihkyectnenvnbng.supabase.co/functions/v1/city-brand-spectra-icon\" alt=\"SPECTRA brand artwork\"><span>01</span></a><div class=\"body\"><small>STRUCTURE</small><h2>SPECTRA</h2><p>What structure is there?</p><a href=\"https://prairie-dream-glow-fire.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch lab ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><a class=\"art\" href=\"https://giant-beacon-dawn-falcon.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://gpkjvihkyectnenvnbng.supabase.co/functions/v1/city-brand-fold-icon\" alt=\"Fold brand artwork\"><span>02</span></a><div class=\"body\"><small>INVARIANCE</small><h2>Fold</h2><p>What survives transformation?</p><a href=\"https://giant-beacon-dawn-falcon.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch lab ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><a class=\"art\" href=\"https://kite-glade-tiger-cabin.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://gpkjvihkyectnenvnbng.supabase.co/functions/v1/city-brand-murmuration-icon\" alt=\"Murmuration brand artwork\"><span>03</span></a><div class=\"body\"><small>DYNAMICS</small><h2>Murmuration</h2><p>How does structure move and reorganize?</p><a href=\"https://kite-glade-tiger-cabin.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch lab ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><a class=\"art\" href=\"https://moon-clear-urban-nova.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://gpkjvihkyectnenvnbng.supabase.co/functions/v1/city-brand-mnemosyne-icon\" alt=\"Mnemosyne brand artwork\"><span>04</span></a><div class=\"body\"><small>MEMORY</small><h2>Mnemosyne</h2><p>What did we know, and when did we know it?</p><a href=\"https://moon-clear-urban-nova.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch lab ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><a class=\"art\" href=\"https://winter-dawn-leaf-marble.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://gpkjvihkyectnenvnbng.supabase.co/functions/v1/city-brand-density-icon\" alt=\"Density brand artwork\"><span>05</span></a><div class=\"body\"><small>MEASUREMENT</small><h2>Density</h2><p>What can we reconstruct from incomplete observation?</p><a href=\"https://winter-dawn-leaf-marble.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch lab ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><a class=\"art\" href=\"https://zenith-fjord-pearl-pixel.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://gpkjvihkyectnenvnbng.supabase.co/functions/v1/city-brand-horizon-icon\" alt=\"Horizon brand artwork\"><span>06</span></a><div class=\"body\"><small>PREDICTION</small><h2>Horizon</h2><p>What invariant comes next?</p><a href=\"https://zenith-fjord-pearl-pixel.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch lab ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><a class=\"art\" href=\"https://apex-star-crisp-blend.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://gpkjvihkyectnenvnbng.supabase.co/functions/v1/city-brand-wave-icon\" alt=\"Wave brand artwork\"><span>07</span></a><div class=\"body\"><small>FLOW</small><h2>Wave</h2><p>How does coherent structure evolve in a fluid?</p><a href=\"https://apex-star-crisp-blend.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch lab ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><a class=\"art\" href=\"https://mist-mint-branch-nova.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://gpkjvihkyectnenvnbng.supabase.co/functions/v1/city-brand-identity-icon\" alt=\"Identity brand artwork\"><span>08</span></a><div class=\"body\"><small>PERSISTENCE</small><h2>Identity</h2><p>What remains the same as the system changes?</p><a href=\"https://mist-mint-branch-nova.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch lab ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><a class=\"art\" href=\"https://brave-ivory-pearl-ever.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://gpkjvihkyectnenvnbng.supabase.co/functions/v1/city-brand-build-icon\" alt=\"BUILD brand artwork\"><span>09</span></a><div class=\"body\"><small>CONSTRUCTION</small><h2>BUILD</h2><p>How does structure assemble around an invariant?</p><a href=\"https://brave-ivory-pearl-ever.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch lab ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><a class=\"art\" href=\"https://topaz-solar-iris-drift.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://gpkjvihkyectnenvnbng.supabase.co/functions/v1/city-brand-soar-icon\" alt=\"SOAR brand artwork\"><span>10</span></a><div class=\"body\"><small>RESTORATION</small><h2>SOAR</h2><p>Can an invariant sector be restored and deliberately transformed without leaving itself?</p><a href=\"https://topaz-solar-iris-drift.grok.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch lab ↗</a></div></article></section><footer>Canonical brand set · MC-LABS-BRAND-20260910 · presentation identity only; evidence classes remain lab-specific.</footer></main></body></html>"
